1
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:08,680
I've worked out what this Nano Card is.

2
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,000
If we collect the Nano Cards and analyze
them, we can get back to our normal size.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,500
- Really? All right!
- Sharp of you to notice.

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:24,000
But we, the Ukki Five,
are holding on to those Nano Cards.

5
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:34,850
Not that you could get them back,
shrunk the way you are.

6
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:40,750
And we're using your friends
to study humans.

7
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,880
You don't stand a chance anymore.

8
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:47,410
Well, do your best.

9
00:00:48,410 --> 00:00:52,950
Who does he think he is?
I'll beat them to a pulp!

10
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:56,140
With our friends together,
there's nothing to be scared of!

11
00:00:56,820 --> 00:01:00,600
That's right! Let's collect
the Nano Cards and save everyone.

12
00:01:01,270 --> 00:01:03,250
We'll get back to our normal size!

